# One line per identity a contributor has committed under, mapped to the
# GitHub account that did the work. The build derives each contributor's
# GitHub login from the canonical <login>@users.noreply.github.com address,
# so a contributor who commits with GitHub's private address needs no line
# here. Bots and agents are co-authors in commit trailers, never authors,
# and never appear on the site.
